    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Slam [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str).</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up); target knocked Prone; no save.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 3:</strong> 8 damage + Prone; target Restrained by earth and stone until they succeed on a Might [hard] check as a [Combat] action.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Immovable: Cannot be knocked Prone by non-magical forced movement. Shoves automatically fail unless the attacker wins an opposed Strength + Athletics [Hard] check. Earth Bond: While standing on natural earth or stone, regains 4 HP at the start of its turn. Suppressed if it took magical damage this round.</p>",
    "reactionsNotes": "<p>Stone Skin [Reaction]: Once per round when hit by a physical attack, reduce incoming damage by 4.</p>",
